         <documentation id="documentation_55978eb5-d802-4cbc-8d61-e85178eaab40"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-004.
 
Decision: Route the prepared adjustment according to the independent review outcome.
 
Yes: The reviewer has approved the adjustment input. Continue to posting in SYS-FAP.
 
No - correction required: Return the input to the maker for correction and subsequent independent review. The returned input must not proceed to posting.]]></documentation>
