         <documentation id="documentation_7222356b-371f-4585-8679-f47fed809aa3"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-PR-008; CSP-AC-005; CSP-AC-006.
 
Input: An unresolved accounting or NAV exception and the available investigation findings.
 
Handling: Record the affected trade or population, exception classification, known accounting state, potential NAV impact, supporting evidence, assigned owner, and required next action. Update the operational lifecycle tracker and escalate to the responsible owner for further action.
 
Output: Documented and escalated exceptions with an assigned owner, supporting evidence, and a recorded follow-up action.]]></documentation>
