      <exclusiveGateway name="Accounting adjustment successfully applied?"
                         id="_7348b879-6ac5-49e0-8732-936b4e0eaccc"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_7348b879-6ac5-49e0-8732-936b4e0eaccc"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-005.
 
Decision: Determine whether the reviewed SYS-FAP result confirm that the approved accounting adjustment was correctly applied.
 
Yes: The resulting accounting state matches the approved adjustment. Continue with the applicable accounting and NAV outcome checks.
 
No: The adjustment was rejected, was not applied, or produced an inconsistent or unconfirmed result. Continue with accounting-processing exception investigation.]]></documentation>
