      <startEvent name="Accounting review required"
                   id="_7ff3e92d-9b89-4848-a168-9c9b55ccfc66">
         <documentation id="documentation_7ff3e92d-9b89-4848-a168-9c9b55ccfc66"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-001; CSP-AC-002.
 
Trigger: Accepted valuation results or a lifecycle, maturity, or settlement event requires accounting and NAV review.
 
Context: The review uses the relevant operational outcome, current SYS-FAP postings, and available supporting evidence. Entry into this process does not imply that settlement is complete or that an accounting adjustment is required.
 
Output: Accounting review initiated for the applicable trade or population.]]></documentation>
