      <manualTask name="Review the accounting adjustment posting result"
                   id="_900f7869-1734-435c-906c-aaadee4c0783"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_900f7869-1734-435c-906c-aaadee4c0783"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-005.
 
Input: Approved adjustment input, SYS-FAP processing result, and resulting accounting postings.
 
Handling: Compare the resulting postings with the approved adjustment. Confirm that the intended accounting change has been applied and that historical postings remain visible. Identify rejected, missing, or inconsistent results requiring investigation.
 
Output: Confirmed accounting state, or an identified accounting-processing exception.
 
 ]]></documentation>
