      <manualTask name="Prepare the controlled journal or FAP adjustment input"
                   id="_a70f169e-1b95-4104-81df-dc469a278016"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_a70f169e-1b95-4104-81df-dc469a278016"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-003; CSP-AC-004.
 
Input: Defined accounting adjustment requirement and supporting evidence, or an adjustment returned by the reviewer with correction requirements.
 
Handling: Manually prepare the controlled journal or FAP adjustment input. Include the trade reference, amount, currency, accounts, sign, accounting date, rationale, and supporting evidence. Where the input has been returned, address the review findings before resubmitting it to a separate reviewer.
 
Output: Prepared or corrected journal or FAP adjustment input ready for independent review.
 ]]></documentation>
