      <manualTask name="Investigate the accounting or NAV exception"
                   id="_d935101d-891f-48bb-9fc8-a47e84114741"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_d935101d-891f-48bb-9fc8-a47e84114741"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CPS-PR-008; CSP-AC-002; CSP-AC-005; CSP-AC-006.
 
Input: An undetermined adjustment requirement, an unsuccessful or unconfirmed posting result, or an unaccepted accounting and NAV outcome.
 
Handling: Investigate the issue using current postings, processing results, and relevant operational evidence. Establish what has actually been applied before considering further accounting action. Obtain missing evidence and coordinate clarification with the responsible owner. Determine whether the item can return to accounting reassessment.
 
Output: Investigation findings and sufficient evidence for reassessment, or an unresolved exception requiring documentation and escalation.]]></documentation>
