      <exclusiveGateway name="Can the item proceed to accounting reassessment?"
                         id="_fdd85abc-6358-4710-8b6b-984463680abf"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_fdd85abc-6358-4710-8b6b-984463680abf"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-PR-008; CSP-AC-002; CSP-AC-005.
 
Decision: Determine whether the investigation has established sufficient reliable evidence to reassess the accounting requirement.
 
Yes: Return to the initial valuation and accounting results review using the clarified state and investigation findings. Any required adjustment remains subject to preparation and independent approval.
 
No: The item cannot proceed to reassessment because the necessary evidence or clarification remains unavailable. Document and escalate the unresolved exception.]]></documentation>
